     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The loop's termination condition is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">n = 0</code>; therefore, the value of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">n</code> after the loop equals <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">0</code>. The last printed line will be: <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">value of n after the loop is 0</code>."
    }
